From 9c0d830fb574f03d5fbff5e5aa84687045ea0c55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexey Lapin <a.lapin03@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:14:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: seed the Hone booth demo and embed the Hone dashboard

With HONE_DEMO=1 the server asks Hone for its prepared demo on start and on
the new hone.demoReset RPC. It force deletes the previous demo project,
rewrites the project folder, writes each Pi session under a fresh file name
and records each chat as completed runs bound to that session. A new message
in a prepared chat resumes the same Pi session, and its replies keep the Hone
rating control.

The rating control shows the feedback Hone already holds for the session,
read through the new hone.threadFeedback RPC. The sidebar gets a Hone button
that opens the dashboard inside t3code and, in demo mode, a Reset demo button
with a short confirmation. Demo chats open with the Files panel, so the Inbox
files can be dragged into the composer.
